249:The authors of~\cite{Cameron07} describe a beautiful construction for converting a \emph{real} orthogonal representation in dimension four into a quantum 4-coloring, and similarly for dimension eight. The constructions use quaternions and octonions respectively. We briefly describe the construction for dimension four, but dimension eight is similar.
